---
/**
 * Footer — Rodapé institucional reutilizável
 * Corrige: copyright 2026, dados reais, aria-labels
 */
---

<footer class="bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 pt-16 pb-8">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16">
        <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
            <a href="/" class="mb-6 block" aria-label="Página inicial da ContábilPro">
                <img src="/assets/img/Logo-Contabil.png" alt="Logotipo ContábilPro" class="w-48 md:w-64 lg:w-72 h-auto object-contain" />
            </a>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Excelência em arquitetura contábil e consultoria estratégica para empresas que buscam soberania financeira e crescimento sustentável.
            </p>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
                <a href="https://instagram.com/contabilpro"
                   aria-label="Siga-nos no Instagram"
                   target="_blank"
                   rel="noopener noreferrer"
                   class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 hover:text-primary hover:border-primary transition-all shadow-sm">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"/></svg>
                </a>
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/company/contabilpro"
                   aria-label="Siga-nos no LinkedIn"
                   target="_blank"
                   rel="noopener noreferrer"
                   class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 hover:text-primary hover:border-primary transition-all shadow-sm">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest">Institucional</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
                <li><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="/">Início</a></li>
                <li><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="/sobre">Sobre Nós</a></li>
                <li><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="/blog">Insights & Blog</a></li>
                <li><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="/compliance">Compliance & LGPD</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest">Serviços</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
                <li><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="/servicos">Gestão Contábil</a></li>
                <li><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="/servicos">Planejamento Tributário</a></li>
                <li><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="/servicos">BPO Financeiro</a></li>
                <li><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="/servicos">Consultoria Empresarial</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest">Contato</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary" aria-hidden="true">mail</span>
                    <a href="mailto:contato@contabilpro.com.br" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">contato@contabilpro.com.br</a>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary" aria-hidden="true">call</span>
                    <a href="tel:+552140040000" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">(21) 4004-0000</a>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary" aria-hidden="true">location_on</span>
                    Rio de Janeiro, RJ
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-8 px-8">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">
            <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} ContábilPro. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
            <div class="flex gap-6">
                <span class="font-medium">CRC: RJ-123456/O</span>
                <span class="font-medium">CNPJ: 12.345.678/0001-00</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
